    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>IMPORTANT: Requires WooCommerce to work.</p>\n<p>Plugin for importing products from WooCommerce to OZON. Helps to increase sales.</p>\n<p>Instructions for configuring the plugin:<br />\n<a href=\"https://icopydoc.ru/nastrojka-plagina-import-products-to-ozon/?utm_source=wp-repository&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=import-products-to-ozon&amp;utm_content=readme&amp;utm_term=instruction\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://icopydoc.ru/nastrojka-plagina-import-products-to-ozon/</a></p>\n<p>PRO version: <a href=\"https://icopydoc.ru/product/plagin-import-products-to-ozon-pro/?utm_source=wp-repository&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=import-products-to-ozon&amp;utm_content=readme&amp;utm_term=pro-version\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://icopydoc.ru/product/plagin-import-products-to-ozon-pro/</a></p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='what%20plugin%20online%20store%20supported%20by%20your%20plugin%3F'>\nWhat plugin online store supported by your plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Only Woocommerce.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>0.7.11</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 07-10-2025</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bug with price.</li>\n<li>Added support for WooCommerce brands.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.7.10</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 27-05-2025</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Changes have been made to the API in accordance with the new requirements of the OZON.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.7.9</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 29-04-2025</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Added support for automatic product addition to promotions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.7.8</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 14-03-2025</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Added compatibility with the &#8220;WooCommerce Currency Switcher by PluginUs.NET. Woo Multi Currency and Wood Multi Pay&#8221; plugin.</li>\n<li>Added VAT rates of 5% and 7%.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.7.7</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 13-01-2025</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs.</li>\n<li>API methods updated.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.7.6</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 08-01-2025</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>API methods updated.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.7.5</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 09-11-2024</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.7.4</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 07-11-2024</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed interface bugs.</li>\n<li>Updated instructions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.1.0</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 10-04-2023</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>First relise.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
